#### With the Mouse

1. **Multiple characters**: Click and drag the mouse across any text to select it.
2. **A single word**: Double-click anywhere on a word to select the entire word. 
3. **Multiple words**: Double-click a word and without releasing the mouse drag to extend your selection word by word.
3. **A single line**: Triple-click on a line to select the whole line, including the invisible newline character at the end.

